# 统一换行符：仓库为 Windows 专用项目（WPF），文本文件固定 CRLF，
# 与 .editorconfig 的 end_of_line = crlf 及 `dotnet format --verify-no-changes` 保持一致。
* text=auto eol=crlf

# 二进制资源不做转换
*.gif binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
*.7z binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.bin binary
*.elf binary
*.db binary
*.sqlite binary
*.sqlite3 binary
*.nupkg binary
